#: deathforth/events/unlock/trait1.df:129
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/trait1.df"
msgid "Trait Unlocking"
msgstr "특성 해금"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/trait1.df:131
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/trait1.df"
msgid ""
"I'm developing an amazing new product\r\n"
"\tI call them... unlocks. Or 'uncks' for short\r\n"
"\tWitness the magic of 'cheevos'!\r\n"
"\tWait, I meant to say 'unlocks'."
msgstr ""
"놀라운 신제품을 개발 중이야.\r\n"
"\t이름은... 해금. 줄여서 '해꾸'라고 하지.\r\n"
"\t'업적'의 마법을 봐!\r\n"
"\t잠깐, '해금'이라고 하려던 거야."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/trait1.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/trait1.df"
msgid ""
"I'm no longer allowed to call them 'Uncks'. The gnomes got very upset that I was stealing their bit.\r\n"
"\t\tLet's call them Trait Unlocks. Or 'Trunlocks'."
msgstr ""
"이제 '해꾸'라고 부르면 안 돼. 노움들이 자기 개그를 훔쳤다고 엄청 화를 냈거든.\r\n"
"\t\t특성 해금이라고 부르자. 줄여서 '특금'."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/trait1.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/trait1.df"
msgid ""
"Experiment with different traits and perks.\r\n"
"\t\tYou might find a new favorite combination!"
msgstr ""
"특성과 특전을 다양하게 조합해 봐.\r\n"
"\t\t새롭게 마음에 드는 조합을 찾을지도 몰라!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/trait1.df:152
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/trait1.df"
msgid ""
"I'm out of Trunlocks!\r\n"
"\t\tUse these precious gifts wisely.\r\n"
"\t\tBelieve... in the Trunlocks."
msgstr ""
"특금이 다 떨어졌어!\r\n"
"\t\t이 소중한 선물을 현명하게 써.\r\n"
"\t\t믿어 봐... 특금을."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/trait1.df:161
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/trait1.df"
msgid "Leave for now"
msgstr "일단 떠난다"

