msgstr "좀비를 쓰러뜨리는 것은 때로 죽이는 것만큼 효과적이다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:612
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Knocked down zombies always take at least 1 damage. Even a punch can kill "
"zombies this way!"
msgstr "쓰러진 좀비는 항상 피해를 최소 1 받는다. 이 상태라면 주먹으로도 좀비를 죽일 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:613
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "In addition, zombies in this state take 2x the damage from weapons."
msgstr "또한 이 상태의 좀비는 무기에 2배 피해를 받는다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:614
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Zombies on the floor are harder to move compared to upright ones."
msgstr "바닥에 누운 좀비는 서 있는 좀비보다 밀어내기 어렵다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:615
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "THANKS FOR THE INFODUMP"
msgstr "설명 폭격 고마워"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:619
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON COMBAT: 1"
msgstr "전투 설명: 1"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:620
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Nearly all melee and ranged hits inflict stun to a zombie."
msgstr "거의 모든 근접 및 원거리 공격은 맞은 좀비를 기절시킨다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:621
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Whip class weapons are special, as they inflict stun for extra time compared"
" to normal."
msgstr "채찍 계열 무기는 특별해서 보통보다 더 오래 기절시킨다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:622
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Stunned zombies cannot do anything. This includes grappling and biting "
"characters."
msgstr "기절한 좀비는 아무것도 못 한다. 캐릭터를 붙잡거나 무는 것도 불가능하다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:623
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "You can also achieve this effect by knocking zombies down."
msgstr "좀비를 쓰러뜨려도 같은 효과를 얻을 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:624
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "THANKS NERD"
msgstr "고마워, 찌질아"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:625
#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:636
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Study combat further"
msgstr "전투 더 알아보기"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:629
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON COMBAT: 0"
msgstr "전투 설명: 0"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:630
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"All damage dealt to zombies, whether melee, explosion or bullet, is "
"randomised."
msgstr "근접 공격, 폭발, 총알 등 좀비에게 주는 모든 피해는 무작위다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:631
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Damage is a random number from 1 to 5, multiplied by weapon power, rounded "
"down."
msgstr "1에서 5 사이의 무작위 수에 무기 위력을 곱하고 소수점 아래를 버린다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:632
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"For example, a hatchet has a power of 1.25. If a hatchet swing hits a zombie"
" and rolls a 3, it would deal..."
msgstr "예를 들어 손도끼의 위력은 1.25다. 손도끼로 좀비를 때렸을 때 무작위 수가 3이라면..."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:633
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "1.25 * 3 = 3.75, rounded down -> 3 damage to the zombie."
msgstr "1.25 * 3 = 3.75, 소수점을 버리면 -> 좀비에게 피해 3."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:634
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "On every mode except MUTATION EXTREME, zombies have 5 HP."
msgstr "돌연변이 익스트림을 제외한 모든 모드에서 좀비의 HP는 5다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:686
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON CHARACTERS: 2"
msgstr "캐릭터 설명: 2"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:687
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "A good team is made up of a mix of support and combat characters."
msgstr "좋은 일행에는 지원과 전투 담당 캐릭터가 함께 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:688
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "GOOD MELEE CHAR COMBOS: "
msgstr "추천 근접 캐릭터 조합: "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:688
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Megabuff + Warrior, Martial Artist + Warrior, Fighter + Warrior, Fighter + "
"Craftsman, Kensai + Berserk"
msgstr "근육 괴물 + 전사, 무술가 + 전사, 싸움꾼 + 전사, 싸움꾼 + 장인, 검성 + 광전사"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:689
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "GOOD RANGED CHAR COMBOS: "
msgstr "추천 원거리 캐릭터 조합: "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:689
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Natural Shot + Calm Under Fire, Ranger + Hyperfixated, Gun Collector + Calm "
"Under Fire, Gun Collector + Hyperfixated"
msgstr "타고난 사수 + 포화 속 침착, 레인저 + 과몰입, 총기 수집가 + 포화 속 침착, 총기 수집가 + 과몰입"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:690
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "GOOD SUPPORT CHAR COMBOS: "
msgstr "추천 지원 캐릭터 조합: "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:690
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Health Care + Nurturing, Surgeon + Civilized, Car Nut + Paranoid, Car Nut + "
"Craftsman"
msgstr "간호 + 보살핌, 외과의 + 교양인, 자동차광 + 편집증, 자동차광 + 장인"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:691
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "GOOD UTILITY OR HYBRID COMBOS: "
msgstr "추천 보조/혼합 캐릭터 조합: "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:691
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Explorer + City Seeker, Explorer + Gourmand, Pathfinder + Paranoid, "
"Gungineer + Civilized"
msgstr "탐험가 + 도시파, 탐험가 + 대식가, 길잡이 + 편집증, 총기 기술자 + 교양인"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:692
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Experiment for yourself!"
msgstr "직접 실험해 보자!"

