msgid "NOTES ON CHARACTERS: 0"
msgstr "캐릭터 설명: 0"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:713
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Character perks generally affect action and combat. Traits generally affect "
"personality."
msgstr "특전은 대체로 행동과 전투에, 특성은 대체로 성격에 영향을 준다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:714
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Traits may give certain stat combos. These combos present useful options in "
"road events."
msgstr "특성에 따라 특정 능력치 조합을 얻을 수 있다. 이런 조합은 도로 이벤트에서 유용한 선택지를 제공한다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:715
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Stats are measured "
msgstr "능력치 범위는 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:715
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " to "
msgstr " ~ "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:715
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
", or 0 to 6 in numbers. MAX BONUSES move the range. A +1 bonus to a stat "
"means the range is "
msgstr "이며 숫자로는 0~6이다. 최대치 보너스는 이 범위를 바꾼다. 능력치에 +1 보너스를 받으면 범위는 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:715
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ", or 1 to 7 in numbers."
msgstr "이며 숫자로는 1~7이다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:716
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "For example, the Paranoid stat combo is granted by at least "
msgstr "예를 들어 편집증 능력치 조합의 조건은 최소 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:716
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " Wits and at most "
msgstr " 재치와 최대 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:717
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Further stat combinations will be listed on the next page."
msgstr "다음 쪽에는 다른 능력치 조합이 나와 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:718
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "OK DORK"
msgstr "알았어, 바보야"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:723
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON MELEE STATS: DEXTERITY"
msgstr "근접 능력치 설명: 민첩"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:724
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Dexterity is powerful, but the rarest stat to train."
msgstr "민첩은 강력하지만 올리기 가장 어려운 능력치다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:725
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Dexterity increases movement speed, allowing you to juke or escape easier."
msgstr "민첩은 이동 속도를 높여 적을 피하거나 달아나기 쉽게 해 준다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:726
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Sources of dexterity are difficult to come by. Under the most ideal "
"conditions, you might reach 3 dexterity, if you're lucky and use the right "
"trait."
msgstr "민첩을 얻을 방법은 드물다. 조건이 아주 좋고, 운도 따르고, 알맞은 특성까지 쓰면 민첩 3에 도달할 수도 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:727
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"High dexterity can make it significantly more difficult to get bitten. In "
"Extreme Weather Mode, high dexterity can be a hinderance due to ice."
msgstr "민첩이 높으면 물릴 위험이 크게 줄어든다. 극한 날씨 모드에서는 얼음 때문에 높은 민첩이 오히려 방해가 될 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:728
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"If you have high morale before the City of Crushed Hopes siege, your "
"characters may gain dexterity. The easiest way to ensure this occurs is to "
"have spare food supplies."
msgstr ""
"무너진 희망의 도시 포위전 전에 사기가 높으면 민첩을 얻을 수 있다. 가장 확실한 준비 방법은 여분의 식량을 확보하는 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:729
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "THANKS GIGANERD"
msgstr "고마워, 초거대 찌질아"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:734
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON MELEE STATS: FITNESS"
msgstr "근접 능력치 설명: 체력"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:735
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Fitness is also important, but harder to train."
msgstr "체력도 중요하지만 훈련하기 더 어렵다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:736
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"6 points in fitness increase stamina regen by 1x, additively. An additional "
"1x is added for every 5 levels of fitness afterwards."
msgstr "체력이 6이면 지구력 회복 속도에 기본 속도 1배분이 더해진다. 이후 체력 5마다 기본 속도 1배분이 더 추가된다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:737
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"For example, a char at 6 fitness recovers stamina at 2x as fast. At 11 "
"fitness, 3x as fast."
msgstr "예를 들어 체력 6인 캐릭터는 지구력을 2배로 회복한다. 체력이 11이면 3배로 회복한다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:738
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Intermittent levels of fitness (like 4, 5, 8 or 9) do "
msgstr "중간 단계의 체력(4, 5, 8, 9 등)은 회복 속도에 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:738
#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:750
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOT"
msgstr "전혀"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:738
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " provide regen benefits."
msgstr " 추가 효과를 주지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:739
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Every 2 cumulative points in STR and FIT decrease melee weapon cooldown by "
"10%, up to 0.65s cooldown."
msgstr "근력과 체력의 합이 2 늘 때마다 근접 무기 재공격 시간이 10% 줄어든다. 최소 재공격 시간은 0.65초다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:740
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "THANKS MEGANERD"
msgstr "고마워, 거대 찌질아"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:741
#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:752
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Study melee further"
msgstr "근접 능력치 더 알아보기"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:745
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON MELEE STATS: STRENGTH"
msgstr "근접 능력치 설명: 근력"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:746
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Strength is an important melee stat. It is one of the easiest to train."
msgstr "근력은 중요한 근접 능력치다. 훈련하기 가장 쉬운 능력치 중 하나다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:747
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Every point of strength (and fitness, too) reduces weapon swing stamina "
"cost. Strength also allows you to throw heavier objects."
msgstr ""
"근력(체력도 마찬가지)이 1 늘 때마다 무기를 휘두를 때 쓰는 지구력이 줄어든다. 근력이 높으면 더 무거운 물건도 던질 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:748
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Chairs can be thrown with 0 strength. Most furniture requires at least 2. "
"Most bathroom or kitchen pieces require 7 or more."
msgstr "의자는 근력 0으로도 던질 수 있다. 대부분의 가구는 최소 2가 필요하다. 욕실이나 주방 설비 대부분은 7 이상이 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:749
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Heavier objects tend to be more resilient and deal more damage on impact."
msgstr "무거운 물건일수록 대체로 더 튼튼하고 부딪혔을 때 더 큰 피해를 준다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:750
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "IMPORTANT NOTE: STRENGTH DOES "
msgstr "중요: 근력은 근접 피해에 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:750
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " AFFECT MELEE DAMAGE."
msgstr " 영향을 주지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:756
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON RANGED STATS: RIFLE STATS"
msgstr "원거리 능력치 설명: 소총 수치"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:757
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Cowboy Rifle"
msgstr "카우보이 소총"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:757
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " - scales slowly. Penetrates 0-2 targets. Works best at 6 shooting."
msgstr " - 성장 속도 낮음. 0~2개 표적 관통. 사격 6에서 최적 성능."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:758
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Hunting Rifle"
msgstr "사냥용 소총"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:758
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " - scales normally. Penetrates 1-6 targets. Works best at 8 shooting."
msgstr " - 성장 속도 보통. 1~6개 표적 관통. 사격 8에서 최적 성능."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:759
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Sniper Rifle"
msgstr "저격 소총"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:759
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
" - scales normally. Penetrates 1-5 targets. Quiet. Works best at 8 shooting."
msgstr " - 성장 속도 보통. 1~5개 표적 관통. 조용함. 사격 8에서 최적 성능."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:760
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " - scales normally. Penetrates 2-8 targets. Works best at 9 shooting."
msgstr " - 성장 속도 보통. 2~8개 표적 관통. 사격 9에서 최적 성능."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:761
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " - scales quickly. Penetrates 3-11 targets. Max at 7 shooting."
msgstr " - 성장 속도 높음. 3~11개 표적 관통. 사격 7에서 최대 성능."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:762
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " - scales normally. Penetrates 1-4 targets. Max at 6 shooting."
msgstr " - 성장 속도 보통. 1~4개 표적 관통. 사격 6에서 최대 성능."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:763
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Don't forget firearms. Save your ammo. Auto-weapons are powerful too!"
msgstr "총기도 잊지 말자. 탄약을 아끼자. 자동 화기도 강력하다!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:764
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "OK SNIPER"
msgstr "알았어, 저격수"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:769
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "RANGED STATS: LINEAR PENETRATION"
msgstr "원거리 능력치: 선형 관통"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:770
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Linear penetration is exclusive to select weapons."
msgstr "선형 관통은 특정 무기만 가진 특성이다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:771
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"This type is found on slow-firing rifles, including but not limited to..."
msgstr "이 관통은 발사 속도가 느린 소총에 있다. 예를 들면..."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:772
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Cowboy Rifle, Hunting Rifle, Sniper Rifle, M.O.A.R, Slug Shotgun, Mamba"
msgstr "카우보이 소총, 사냥용 소총, 저격 소총, M.O.A.R, 슬러그 산탄총, 맘바"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:773
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Linear penetration is consistent; every shot from these weapons will "
"penetrate. The number of targets hit from these weapons scales LINEARLY with"
" shooting."
msgstr "선형 관통은 일정하다. 이 무기들의 모든 탄환은 관통한다. 맞힐 수 있는 표적 수는 사격에 비례해 일정하게 늘어난다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:774
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Under the right circumstances these weapons can penetrate objects and "
"shelves."
msgstr "조건이 맞으면 물건이나 선반도 관통할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:775
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Every target penetrated incurs a multiplicative damage/knockback loss of 18%"
" for the bullet."
msgstr "표적을 하나 관통할 때마다 탄환의 피해와 밀어내기가 18%씩 감소한다. 이 감소는 곱연산으로 적용된다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:776
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "The next page outlines some common rifle stats."
msgstr "다음 쪽에는 주요 소총의 수치가 나와 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:777
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "OK MARKSMAN"
msgstr "알았어, 명사수"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:778
#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:790
#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:802
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Study ranged further"
msgstr "원거리 능력치 더 알아보기"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:782
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "RANGED STATS: NORMAL PENETRATION"
msgstr "원거리 능력치: 일반 관통"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:783
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Normal penetration is the most common type."
msgstr "일반 관통은 가장 흔한 관통 방식이다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:784
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"This type is found on many automatic weapons, and particularly in revolvers."
msgstr "많은 자동 화기에 있으며 특히 리볼버에 많다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:785
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Normal penetration is RNG based. In order for a shot to penetrate in this "
"way, it must kill the initial target."
msgstr "일반 관통은 확률에 따라 결정된다. 이 방식으로 관통하려면 첫 번째 표적을 죽여야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:786
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"In most cases, this type of penetration may occasionally give an additional "
"hit or two."
msgstr "대부분의 경우 이 관통은 가끔 한두 표적을 더 맞힌다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:787
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Furthermore, these bullets are blocked by objects."
msgstr "또한 이 탄환들은 물건에 막힌다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:788
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "The next page outlines linear penetration."
msgstr "다음 쪽에는 선형 관통이 설명돼 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:789
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "OK HOTSHOT"
msgstr "알았어, 총잡이"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:794
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON RANGED STATS: SHOOTING"
msgstr "원거리 능력치 설명: 사격"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:795
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Shooting is helpful for all firearms and essential for some. Firing in "
"bursts helps with recoil."
msgstr "사격은 모든 총기에 도움이 되며 일부 총기에는 필수다. 짧게 끊어 쏘면 반동을 줄일 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:796
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Every point of shooting reduces post-shot recoil and improves bullet "
"piercing."
msgstr "사격이 1 늘 때마다 발사 후 반동이 줄고 탄환 관통이 좋아진다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:797
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Firearms have two types of penetration:"
msgstr "총기 관통에는 두 종류가 있다:"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:797
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " normal"
msgstr " 일반 관통과 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:797
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "linear."
msgstr "선형 관통."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:798
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Normal penetration is for nearly all non-rifle weapons. It scales with "
"shooting and is RNG-based."
msgstr "일반 관통은 소총 외의 거의 모든 무기에 적용된다. 사격에 따라 좋아지며 확률에 영향을 받는다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:799
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Linear penetration is more powerful, more versatile and consistent."
msgstr "선형 관통은 더 강력하고, 다양하게 활용할 수 있고, 일정하다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:800
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "The next page outlines their differences."
msgstr "다음 쪽에는 두 방식의 차이가 나와 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:807
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON SUPPORT STATS: MECHANICAL"
msgstr "지원 능력치 설명: 기계"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:808
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"The mechanical stat affects your ability to restore your car as it takes "
"damage. It also accelerates gas siphoning."
msgstr "기계는 손상된 차를 수리하는 능력에 영향을 준다. 기름을 빼내는 속도도 빨라진다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:809
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Characters with a very low mechanical stat cannot repair the car. Different "
"cars require different mechanical skill to repair."
msgstr "기계가 너무 낮은 캐릭터는 차를 수리할 수 없다. 수리에 필요한 기계 기술은 차마다 다르다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:810
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Every repair made to a car increases the difficulty of the next. For "
"example, if a car takes 2 mechanical skill to repair, next time it'll take "
"3."
msgstr "차를 수리할 때마다 다음 수리의 난이도가 높아진다. 예를 들어 수리에 기계 2가 필요했다면 다음에는 3이 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:811
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "The normal starting car requires "
msgstr "기본 시작 차량의 첫 수리에 필요한 기계 기술은 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:811
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
" (4) mechanical skill to repair the first time. Car Nuts may roll for "
"slightly easier-to-repair cars."
msgstr " (4)이다. 자동차광은 조금 더 수리하기 쉬운 차로 시작할 수도 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:812
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Keeping your car intact makes the journey safer by preventing nasty events "
"and allowing time (i.e day) progression."
msgstr "차를 온전하게 유지하면 위험한 이벤트를 피하고 시간(즉, 날짜)을 진행할 수 있어 여행이 안전해진다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:813
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "OK GREASEBALL"
msgstr "알았어, 기름쟁이"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:818
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON SUPPORT STATS: MEDICAL"
msgstr "지원 능력치 설명: 의술"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:819
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"The medical stat affects how efficiently your party can heal. Healing events"
" occur inbetween every road event."
msgstr "의술은 일행의 치료 효율에 영향을 준다. 치료 이벤트는 도로 이벤트 사이마다 발생한다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:820
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Characters with very a low medical stat may improve slightly when healing. "
"When improving in this way, they may not improve beyond "
msgstr "의술이 아주 낮은 캐릭터는 치료하면서 조금 성장할 수 있다. 이 방식으로 성장할 수 있는 한도는 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:820
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " (3) skill."
msgstr " (3)이다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:821
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Characters with a spectacularly high medical stat do not even require "
"medical supplies ("
msgstr "의술이 굉장히 높은 캐릭터는 치료할 때 의약품("

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:821
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ") to heal."
msgstr ")조차 필요 없다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:822
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "At 0 medical, you may heal once per heal event for 4 "
msgstr "의술 0이면 치료 이벤트마다 한 번 치료할 수 있고, 필요한 의약품은 4 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:822
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ". At 2 medical, you can heal 1x per heal event for 2 "
msgstr ". 의술 2이면 한 번 치료하며 2 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:822
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " per time. At 5 medical, twice per time, for 1 "
msgstr "가 필요하다. 의술 5이면 두 번 치료하며 매번 1 "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:822
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " per time. At 8 medical or higher, you can fortify (overheal.)"
msgstr "가 필요하다. 의술 8 이상이면 체력을 최대치 너머로 보강할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:823
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "High medical also presents an easy counter for certain road events."
msgstr "의술이 높으면 특정 도로 이벤트에도 쉽게 대처할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:824
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "The next page outlines the mechanical stat."
msgstr "다음 쪽에는 기계 능력치가 설명돼 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:825
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "OK DOC"
msgstr "알았어, 의사"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:826
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Study support further"
msgstr "지원 능력치 더 알아보기"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:833
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON PERSONALITY STATS: ALL"
msgstr "성격 능력치 설명: 전체"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:834
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Wits "
msgstr "재치: "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:834
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"represents a character's aptitude and knowledge. It increases loose loot "
"collection radius."
msgstr "캐릭터의 이해력과 지식을 나타낸다. 바닥에 흩어진 물자를 모으는 반경이 늘어난다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:835
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Attitude "
msgstr "태도: "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:835
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"represents a character's optimism and outlook. It has no in-mission effect "
"yet - suggestions welcome!"
msgstr "캐릭터의 낙천성과 관점을 나타낸다. 아직 임무 안에서의 효과는 없다. 의견 환영!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:836
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Composure "
msgstr "침착함: "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:836
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"represents a character's calmness. Low composure characters will attack and "
"panic more in combat."
msgstr "캐릭터의 평정심을 나타낸다. 침착함이 낮으면 전투에서 더 많이 공격하고 더 쉽게 겁먹는다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:837
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Loyalty "
msgstr "충성심: "

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:837
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"represents a character's affinity to the party. High loyalty characters "
"remain closer, making them more effective bodyguards and trustyworthy "
"friends in dangerous events."
msgstr ""
